@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #526d76

participant "Host" as H
participant "Provider" as P
participant "Native VM\n(Runtime)" as R
database "영속 저장소" as D
participant "출력" as O

H -> P : 설치된 Solar descriptor의\nfact 요청
P --> H : occurrence fact\n(due bit 없음)
H -> R : tick_with_solar(clock, facts)
R -> R : admission 준비, when 평가,\nclock, ledger, 상태, 출력,\njournal을 함께 commit
R --> H : outcome + schedule_trace
H -> R : solar_checkpoint()
R --> H : GFSO v1 바이트
H -> D : checkpoint 저장
alt 저장 성공
  H -> O : ON 게시 / 적용
else 저장 실패
  H -> O : 실행 중단, 출력 clear
end
@enduml
